      1						.TITLE UJFP11
      2						.IDENT /00.05/
      3					; CP72 FP11 firmware: direct AC transfers. Absolute HALT FRAM, CP67 module ABI3.
      4					; LDFPS/STFPS/STST support all eight word addressing modes.
      5					; F/D CLR/TST/ABS/NEG/CMP; add/subtract/multiply/divide/conversion remain absent.
